  "body": "I think there should be a way to disable file name adjustments when downloading files via the `download` attribute. For example\n\n```\n<a download=\"LICENSE\" href=\"/file/LICENSE\">Download</a>\n```\n\nIn the above example, `LICENSE` will actually be downloaded as `LICENSE.txt`. This behaviour is quite inappropriate in this case.\n\nI also think that this feature should not be enabled by default.\n",
